<title>HONG KONG: Cathay names Atkinson finance director.</title>
<headline>Cathay names Atkinson finance director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said on Tuesday it has named Rob Atkinson as finance director and board member following the retirement of Victor Hughes.</p>
<p>Atkinson was group managing director Swire Fraser Holdings Ltd, a London insurance concern, until May 1.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective June 21, the Hong Kong flag carrier said in a statement.</p>
<p>Hong Kong conglomerate Swire Pacific Ltd owns about 43.86 percent of Cathay Pacific.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
